taekeb:{"n":"Taeke Berends IJsselstein","d":"c. 1795–1842 · Warga","b":1795,"x":1842,"s":"h","p":["beendouwes","gertjet"],"r":["nl"],"t":"Born at Warga about 1795, the son of Been (Berend) Douwes IJsselstein and Gertje Taekes; the registers call him both Taeke Beens and Taeke Berends. On 27 May 1818, aged 23, he married Antje Lieuwes Kooystra of Eernewoude. They lived at Wartena, where he died on 18 February 1842, aged 47.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1818","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:ea475521-511e-87e9-8ee6-62fa571cb710"],["Death record, 1842","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:3a019666-d715-560a-33a2-add45fefa56e"]]},
antjelk:{"n":"Antje Lieuwes Kooystra","d":"b. c. 1795 · Eernewoude","s":"h","p":["lieuwek","akkea"],"r":["nl"],"b":1795,"t":"Born at Eernewoude about 1795, the daughter of Lieuwe Piebes Kooystra and Akke Aukes. She married Taeke IJsselstein on 27 May 1818 and was widowed at Wartena in 1842, with her son Douwe still a young man.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1818","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:ea475521-511e-87e9-8ee6-62fa571cb710"]]},
ulbe:{"n":"Ulbe Berends Visser","d":"c. 1791–1879","b":1791,"x":1879,"s":"h","p":["berende","grietjes"],"r":["nl"],"t":"The son of Berend (Beernt) Eeltjes Visser and Grietje Sipkes. On 25 July 1812, aged 21, he married Neeltje Durks de Jong; the clerk wrote his name Ulbe Beernts Visscher. They lived at Wartena, where Neeltje died in 1858 and Ulbe on 30 March 1879, aged 88, outliving her by more than twenty years.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1812","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:c5d26f9d-c8a8-509c-1dcb-d41330849fa9"],["Death record, 1879","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:4d45842d-e307-b6c1-095a-8ea97f8e24b4"]]},
neeltje:{"n":"Neeltje Durks de Jong","d":"c. 1791–1858 · Wartena","s":"h","p":["durkfdj","antjero"],"r":["nl"],"b":1791,"x":1858,"t":"The daughter of Durk Folkerts de Jong and Antje Roelofs. On 25 July 1812, both aged 21, she married Ulbe Beernts Visscher (Ulbe Berends Visser). They lived at Wartena for the rest of their lives, and she died there on 11 August 1858, aged 67.","src":[["Marriage, Idaarderadeel, 1812","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:c5d26f9d-c8a8-509c-1dcb-d41330849fa9"],["Death record, 1858","https://www.openarchieven.nl/frl:4c877821-471a-adad-6992-6b640916b707"]]},
